00:49:35.084 --> 00:49:37.793
...and even if I did
I'm sure you don't mind.

525
00:49:41.418 --> 00:49:42.543
Of course not Ms. Briganza.

526
00:49:42.918 --> 00:49:46.001
I called to tell you that
the rehearsals are complete...

527
00:49:46.084 --> 00:49:50.626
...and our college
will come first tomorrow.

528
00:49:51.001 --> 00:49:54.209
Rest of the teams don't stand
a chance. You know what I mean.

529
00:49:55.043 --> 00:49:57.459
This is all because
of you Ms. Briganza.

530
00:49:58.001 --> 00:50:00.084
And it's all for you Malhotra.

531
00:50:01.126 --> 00:50:02.293
Really Ms.Briganza?

532
00:50:03.543 --> 00:50:04.793
Really Malhotra.

533
00:50:05.334 --> 00:50:07.126
Oh Ms. Briganza.

534
00:50:10.084 --> 00:50:12.376
Oh! I have fallen.

535
00:50:13.334 --> 00:50:18.668
And the next college is
our college...St. Xavier's.

536
00:50:33.084 --> 00:50:36.626
What! Oh my god.
They can't make it?

537
00:50:36.751 --> 00:50:39.001
Ms. Briganza there is a
curfew in their area...

538
00:50:39.084 --> 00:50:40.834
...and they can't leave.

539
00:50:40.918 --> 00:50:42.168
Now what do we do?

540
00:50:45.001 --> 00:50:51.751
Mr. Malhotra let me
think please. Idea...

541
00:50:51.834 --> 00:50:52.918
Idea.

542
00:50:55.751 --> 00:50:58.918
You have to do this or else
you both are going to fail.

543
00:51:00.043 --> 00:51:02.168
But Sir how can we sing and dance.

544
00:51:02.251 --> 00:51:03.334
We don't know anything.

545
00:51:03.459 --> 00:51:05.668
You know these students
they will skin us alive.

546
00:51:08.918 --> 00:51:11.126
Ofcourse it's a good idea.
Nothing will happen to you.

547
00:51:11.626 --> 00:51:13.001
The students who were
going to perform today...

548
00:51:13.084 --> 00:51:15.584
...have recorded a
tape of their rehearsals.

549
00:51:15.751 --> 00:51:19.001
I'll play that tape...

550
00:51:19.084 --> 00:51:21.751
...and you just have
to move your lips.

551
00:51:22.709 --> 00:51:25.209
Like in the films. Okay.

552
00:51:26.168 --> 00:51:27.251
It won't work.

553
00:51:27.501 --> 00:51:29.334
What do you mean it won't work.
Ofcourse it will work.

554
00:51:29.418 --> 00:51:33.209
My name is Chin Chin Chu

555
00:51:33.293 --> 00:51:40.334
Moonlit sky you and me
Hello Mr. how do you do?

556
00:51:51.418 --> 00:51:53.001
Anjali you don't
have any concern...

557
00:51:53.084 --> 00:51:55.334
...for the
reputation of your college?

558
00:52:02.793 --> 00:52:05.918
Come on Rahul it
is for the college.

559
00:52:12.001 --> 00:52:15.126
Come on help us Tina.
- No I'm not coming.

560
00:52:15.293 --> 00:52:16.834
What are you saying?

561
00:52:16.918 --> 00:52:20.293
Why are you asking her? Let's go.

562
00:52:41.834 --> 00:52:43.543
What do I play? This must be it.

563
00:52:43.834 --> 00:52:52.043
"You are a foreigner
You are a foreigner

564
00:52:52.418 --> 00:52:56.751
You won't be here
with us for long..."

565
00:53:04.209 --> 00:53:06.543
Looks like I have
put the wrong tape.

566
00:53:21.418 --> 00:53:23.543
Joe music off. Lights off.

567
00:54:13.043 --> 00:54:16.209
I found someone

568
00:54:17.751 --> 00:54:20.668
I found someone

569
00:54:22.418 --> 00:54:25.918
I found someone?

570
00:54:55.501 --> 00:54:58.459
What's come over me?

571
00:54:59.001 --> 00:55:01.918
Why do I feel so lost?

572
00:55:02.459 --> 00:55:09.209
Either I was insane
earlier Or I've just become so.

573
00:55:09.418 --> 00:55:16.251
Dreamy eyes and unkempt hair
What have you done yo yourself.

574
00:55:16.418 --> 00:55:19.668
I found someone...

575
00:55:19.793 --> 00:55:23.251
I've lost my heart...

576
00:55:23.418 --> 00:55:26.751
What can I tell you my friends...

577
00:55:26.876 --> 00:55:30.334
I am all shook up...

578
00:55:30.459 --> 00:55:32.626
I've found someone...

579
00:57:20.084 --> 00:57:23.543
I don't know what's happened to me?

580
00:57:23.668 --> 00:57:27.209
People have begun calling me Romeo.

581
00:57:27.334 --> 00:57:30.793
And why is that so?
We should also know.

582
00:57:31.043 --> 00:57:33.834
What's happened to you?

583
00:57:33.918 --> 00:57:37.668
Till yesterday I was quite fine.

584
00:57:37.918 --> 00:57:41.251
My heart was filled
with happiness devine.

585
00:57:41.376 --> 00:57:45.001
Then why are you upset?
What are you disturbed about?

586
00:57:45.126 --> 00:57:48.001
Have you lost something?

587
00:57:48.084 --> 00:57:51.251
I have found someone...

588
00:58:51.918 --> 00:58:55.334
Who is this disguised as a cloud?

589
00:58:55.459 --> 00:58:58.834
Who has come and
taken over my heart?

590
00:58:58.918 --> 00:59:05.834
I would like to say it
but I can't name it.

591
00:59:05.918 --> 00:59:09.376
Don't name it but say something.

592
00:59:09.501 --> 00:59:13.001
Give us a slight clue.

593
00:59:13.126 --> 00:59:16.626
It's in my eyes It's in my heart

594
00:59:16.918 --> 00:59:19.751
What can I tell you friends...

595
00:59:19.918 --> 00:59:23.126
I've found someone...

596
00:59:44.668 --> 00:59:47.793
I don't know what's happened to me

597
00:59:48.168 --> 00:59:51.376
Why am I so lost

598
00:59:51.918 --> 00:59:58.584
Either I was insane
earlier or I've become so now

599
00:59:58.918 --> 01:00:02.168
Dreamy eyes and unkempt hair

600
01:00:02.334 --> 01:00:05.626
What have you done to yourself

601
01:00:05.751 --> 01:00:08.834
I've found someone...

602
01:00:08.918 --> 01:00:12.543
I've lost my heart...

603
01:00:12.668 --> 01:00:16.043
What can I tell you my friends...

604
01:00:16.126 --> 01:00:19.751
I'm all shook up...

605
01:00:19.834 --> 01:00:26.209
I've found someone...

606
01:01:34.751 --> 01:01:36.751
Anjali what's wrong?

607
01:01:39.668 --> 01:01:43.459
Don't know why I am
missing mom today.

608
01:01:43.834 --> 01:01:46.918
How can you say this
when I am here for you?

609
01:01:52.751 --> 01:01:57.668
Stupid tears don't solve anything.

610
01:02:25.293 --> 01:02:28.793
Anjali how long
have you known Rahul?

611
01:02:29.251 --> 01:02:32.001
From the first day at college.
You know what I did?

612
01:02:32.084 --> 01:02:33.209
I defeated him in arm wrestling.

613
01:02:33.334 --> 01:02:36.209
Eversince we've been best friends.

614
01:02:37.918 --> 01:02:39.668
Rahul is your best friend isn't it?

615
01:02:41.626 --> 01:02:43.084
I am Rahul's best friend.

616
01:02:48.334 --> 01:02:49.543
Aren't you in love with him?

617
01:02:56.168 --> 01:02:59.168
Hi! Shall I go?
- Where?

618
01:03:01.834 --> 01:03:03.459
Today's Tuesday...

619
01:03:03.751 --> 01:03:06.668
Rahul goes to meet his
relatives every Tuesday.

620
01:03:07.918 --> 01:03:10.334
But I'll stay if you want.

621
01:03:10.418 --> 01:03:12.209
No you go Rahul. You'll get late.
- I have some time.

622
01:03:12.293 --> 01:03:16.751
No Rahul you'll be late
go go bye!

623
01:03:32.751 --> 01:03:35.334
God please see that I don't
fail in my exams this time as well

624
01:03:35.418 --> 01:03:38.043
I am a bit weak in Chemistry.
So you take care of it.

625
01:03:52.126 --> 01:03:53.209
Hey! look forward.

626
01:04:06.043 --> 01:04:07.834
So your relatives stay here?

627
01:04:07.918 --> 01:04:11.626
Yes here...here...here...

628
01:04:13.834 --> 01:04:16.834
So Rahul Khanna comes to
the temple every Tuesday.

629
01:04:18.251 --> 01:04:20.001
Yes.
- How sweet.

630
01:04:21.834 --> 01:04:23.126
Why did you lie at college then?

631
01:04:23.834 --> 01:04:26.918
Actually boys don't
go to the temple. So!

632
01:04:27.334 --> 01:04:29.126
But you do...
- Yes.

633
01:04:29.251 --> 01:04:31.251
You come every week?
- Yes.

634
01:04:31.376 --> 01:04:33.668
How sweet...
- Don't call me sweet.

635
01:04:34.001 --> 01:04:36.001
Actually my dad used to say that...

636
01:04:36.084 --> 01:04:37.501
...don't tell this
to anyone at college.

637
01:04:37.668 --> 01:04:41.001
He says that a Man
should bow to 3 women...

638
01:04:41.084 --> 01:04:44.918
to mom-to one's mother
to the Goddess Durga...and...

639
01:04:45.168 --> 01:04:51.084
And?
- And...

640
01:05:05.459 --> 01:05:09.543
Wear it. What do they say
cool you'll look cool.

641
01:05:09.834 --> 01:05:12.543
I was just trying. Don't know
how they wear all this.

642
01:05:12.751 --> 01:05:16.126
There's nothing wrong in
looking girlish once in a while.

643
01:05:17.126 --> 01:05:18.626
Here your mother's letter.

644
01:05:18.918 --> 01:05:20.001
You were missing her weren't you?

645
01:05:20.626 --> 01:05:23.543
And listen take this too.
- What is this?

646
01:05:23.834 --> 01:05:24.918
Present.

647
01:05:35.334 --> 01:05:39.584
Hey Tina.

648
01:05:40.918 --> 01:05:45.084
Rahul...what are you
doing here at this hour?

649
01:05:45.168 --> 01:05:48.001
Actually I couldn't sleep and I
thought even you won't be asleep...

650
01:05:48.084 --> 01:05:50.543
...and would be
thinking of me so I came...

651
01:05:51.084 --> 01:05:53.626
Do you like flowers or chocolates?
- What?

652
01:05:54.043 --> 01:05:55.751
I haven't got either
I was just curious...

653
01:06:02.084 --> 01:06:03.918
Got chocolates too...

654
01:06:06.751 --> 01:06:09.459
...don't you think
it's too hot out here?

655
01:06:14.001 --> 01:06:16.459
Okay! If you insist.

656
01:06:23.418 --> 01:06:25.918
Hey sit down...feel at home.

657
01:06:33.418 --> 01:06:37.793
Isn't this the novel where the
butler murders the married couple?

658
01:06:40.334 --> 01:06:43.834
Why are you wasting your time
reading such a thick book ask me!

659
01:06:43.918 --> 01:06:46.543
Rahul you didn't finish your story.

660
01:06:46.876 --> 01:06:51.001
This couple goes on a holiday
and leaves their butler behind...

661
01:06:51.084 --> 01:06:52.251
Later one finds out the butler is...

662
01:06:52.334 --> 01:06:53.584
Not this story...
- Then?

663
01:06:54.001 --> 01:06:55.209
The one you were
telling me at the temple

664
01:06:55.334 --> 01:06:57.793
Which temple? I
don't know any temple.

665
01:07:01.126 --> 01:07:05.459
The story about a man
bowing to three women...

666
01:07:05.751 --> 01:07:08.668
...one's mother the
goddess Durga and... - Really...

667
01:07:08.834 --> 01:07:12.043
and...
- and?

668
01:07:16.751 --> 01:07:17.834
Papa?
- Groucho...

669
01:07:17.918 --> 01:07:20.001
Shut up. Rahul papa's coming...

670
01:07:20.084 --> 01:07:22.043
Congratulations.
- Shut up Rahul go from here.

671
01:07:22.168 --> 01:07:23.584
No...not from there go from there.

672
01:07:23.668 --> 01:07:25.334
Rahul go from there... - My stair's
here... - Go from there...

673
01:07:25.418 --> 01:07:26.501
I didn't end the story that
a person bows his head...

674
01:07:26.584 --> 01:07:27.668
...in front of three women.

675
01:07:27.751 --> 01:07:29.251
In front of his mother. In front of
Goddess Durga. - Go Rahul. - And..

676
01:07:29.334 --> 01:07:31.418
Rahul go.. Rahu...
- And.. And Tina..

677
01:07:45.001 --> 01:07:46.084
Rahul!

678
01:07:50.751 --> 01:07:51.834
And.

679
01:08:11.376 --> 01:08:15.668
I'll climb this ladder
and catch the culprit

680
01:08:15.918 --> 01:08:17.459
What is it?
- Torch.

681
01:08:17.584 --> 01:08:18.668
Throw it.
- Okay.

682
01:08:18.793 --> 01:08:19.876
Groucho...

683
01:08:23.209 --> 01:08:28.126
Who hit me? A ghost!
I'll become a ghost as well.

684
01:08:28.918 --> 01:08:30.334
The ghost will
also get scared of me.

685
01:08:31.209 --> 01:08:35.918
Where has the ladder gone?

686
01:08:39.168 --> 01:08:40.251
Malhotra!

687
01:08:41.459 --> 01:08:44.376
Why are you sneaking
into your own house?

688
01:08:54.459 --> 01:08:55.751
Rahul what are you doing?

689
01:08:55.834 --> 01:08:57.668
I was om my way to see you.
- Me? why?

690
01:08:57.918 --> 01:09:01.209
Because...hey look. A shooting star.

691
01:09:01.501 --> 01:09:03.126
Where?
- Not down here up there!

692
01:09:04.834 --> 01:09:06.001
They say if you make a
wish on a shooting star...

693
01:09:06.084 --> 01:09:07.918
...your wish comes true.

694
01:09:08.834 --> 01:09:12.793
You believe that?
- Let's try. Come on.

695
01:10:21.501 --> 01:10:23.918
You came close to me

696
01:10:26.834 --> 01:10:29.376
Smiled ever so sweetly.

697
01:10:37.501 --> 01:10:42.709
You gave me dreams.

698
01:10:53.209 --> 01:10:58.376
These days my heart is
neither awake nor asleep

699
01:10:58.584 --> 01:11:03.793
What should I do ?
Somethings happen in my heart.

700
01:11:55.584 --> 01:12:00.668
Oh! What a feeling this is!

701
01:12:00.918 --> 01:12:06.209
What is this unquenchable thirst?

702
01:12:06.334 --> 01:12:14.293
I know not this drunken
stupor of love that's consuming me?

703
01:12:14.418 --> 01:12:19.543
No one knows why one
loses one's peace when in love

704
01:12:19.668 --> 01:12:25.168
What should I do ?
Somethings happen in my heart.

705
01:13:06.001 --> 01:13:11.251
My prayers have been answered

706
01:13:11.376 --> 01:13:16.543
God knows when and
how I fell in love.

707
01:13:16.918 --> 01:13:24.668
I wonder howl
found peace in turmoil.

708
01:13:24.918 --> 01:13:29.918
I sit alone weaving memories.

709
01:13:30.084 --> 01:13:35.376
What should I do?
Somethings happen in my heart...

710
01:14:38.001 --> 01:14:40.001
Butler's the killer...
Butler's the killer...

711
01:14:40.501 --> 01:14:43.376
Hey! Look at that.

712
01:14:51.751 --> 01:14:54.834
Hi guys! How do I look?

713
01:14:58.001 --> 01:14:59.918
Just like Tina right?

714
01:15:52.501 --> 01:16:00.584
Here? Okay. I'm mad aren't I?

715
01:16:02.418 --> 01:16:04.918
I wanted to look
beautiful like you...

716
01:16:06.334 --> 01:16:07.793
...but I don't even know how to.

717
01:16:10.209 --> 01:16:13.209
You are beautiful Anjali.

718
01:16:14.001 --> 01:16:15.084
You're lying.

719
01:16:16.168 --> 01:16:17.626
Didn't you hear them laughing?

720
01:16:18.334 --> 01:16:19.918
Those people are idiots like me.

721
01:16:21.626 --> 01:16:23.001
Actually you're the
most beautiful...

722
01:16:23.084 --> 01:16:25.126
...because you're very special.

723
01:16:26.793 --> 01:16:29.584
Atleast you're not like those
girls I keep running after.

724
01:16:31.668 --> 01:16:35.251
You know you can
have any boy you want.

725
01:16:36.209 --> 01:16:38.668
Anyone?
- Anyone.

726
01:16:39.918 --> 01:16:42.918
Anyone?
- Anyone.

727
01:16:44.001 --> 01:16:45.459
But he has to be cockeyed.

728
01:16:50.918 --> 01:16:53.668
Where did you get this lipstick?

729
01:16:53.751 --> 01:16:56.126
From that girl 'Babli' in our class.

730
01:16:58.418 --> 01:16:59.668
I'll bash her nicely.

731
01:17:01.918 --> 01:17:04.584
And these clothes?
- Shut up.

732
01:17:15.084 --> 01:17:22.001
Love is strange love is weird.

733
01:17:22.418 --> 01:17:28.751
It's unaware of happiness and pain.

734
01:17:28.834 --> 01:17:29.918
Papa

735
01:17:30.084 --> 01:17:31.293
Rahul

736
01:17:31.418 --> 01:17:32.501
Papa?

737
01:17:32.584 --> 01:17:33.668
What papa?

738
01:17:34.043 --> 01:17:36.543
You can't keep secrets from me.

739
01:17:38.001 --> 01:17:40.543
But Rahul? couldn't
you find anyone else?

740
01:17:40.751 --> 01:17:41.834
Come on papa.

741
01:17:43.084 --> 01:17:46.001
Actually I would
have felt as bad...

742
01:17:46.084 --> 01:17:48.543
...even if it were someone else.

743
01:17:49.418 --> 01:17:50.501
Why?

744
01:17:51.584 --> 01:17:53.459
Because I'll have to
share your love with him.

745
01:17:58.001 --> 01:17:59.168
I love you papa.

746
01:18:00.376 --> 01:18:02.251
That is the problem. I love you too.

747
01:18:04.209 --> 01:18:07.043
Have you told him as yet?

748
01:18:18.043 --> 01:18:21.459
I just feel that Rahul and Anjali...

749
01:18:21.584 --> 01:18:25.459
Tina Rahul only loves you...

750
01:18:26.501 --> 01:18:29.918
...and Anjali is his
best friend nothing else.

751
01:18:30.918 --> 01:18:32.001
NO papa.

752
01:18:32.751 --> 01:18:36.668
Somewhere hidden in this
deep friendship is deep love...

753
01:18:37.459 --> 01:18:43.001
...and I don't want to
come in the way of this love.

754
01:18:43.418 --> 01:18:45.001
The whole college knows that...

755
01:18:45.084 --> 01:18:49.251
...Rahul and Anjali are
just friends and nothing else.

756
01:18:49.918 --> 01:18:53.459
Go tell him that you love him.

757
01:18:54.751 --> 01:18:59.043
But I don't even know
if he loves me.

758
01:18:59.793 --> 01:19:01.793
Don't keep matters
of the heart a secret.

759
01:19:01.918 --> 01:19:03.834
Go and tell him.

760
01:19:23.251 --> 01:19:24.543
I love you.

761
01:19:27.793 --> 01:19:28.918
I really love you.

762
01:19:35.084 --> 01:19:37.459
I never thought I'd
say this to someone...

763
01:19:38.043 --> 01:19:40.751
...but I really love you.

764
01:19:45.293 --> 01:19:49.418
I hope I can get
myself to say this to her...

765
01:19:49.501 --> 01:19:52.251
I wanted to say it
to her so often...

766
01:19:52.459 --> 01:19:56.001
...but couldn't get the courage...

767
01:19:56.084 --> 01:20:01.001
...and whenever I meet her I
decide to but... somehow...

768
01:20:01.084 --> 01:20:02.168
Tell whom?

769
01:20:02.918 --> 01:20:04.001
Tina. who else?

770
01:20:05.584 --> 01:20:09.126
Let's do this again.
I'll be Rahul you be Tina.

771
01:20:23.459 --> 01:20:24.543
I love you.

772
01:20:30.626 --> 01:20:31.709
I love you too.

773
01:20:35.834 --> 01:20:36.918
She'll say the
same thing won't she?

774
01:20:39.543 --> 01:20:40.626
Ya.

775
01:20:41.584 --> 01:20:42.668
Come here.

776
01:20:48.168 --> 01:20:49.334
