01:49:01.543 --> 01:49:03.959
Hello!... I love you.

1024
01:49:04.626 --> 01:49:09.376
Huh...Aman!
- Listen I have a problem.

1025
01:49:10.209 --> 01:49:13.543
What?
- Don't leave me like this.

1026
01:49:13.959 --> 01:49:15.543
Aman I don't know
who is on the line.

1027
01:49:16.959 --> 01:49:19.543
And anyway you are going to
Shimla for your summer camp.

1028
01:49:20.626 --> 01:49:21.793
You're going to Bombay as well.

1029
01:49:22.543 --> 01:49:24.959
For 24 hours and
you're going for a month.

1030
01:49:25.376 --> 01:49:29.626
Aman I go there every year
to teach singing and dancing.

1031
01:49:30.126 --> 01:49:32.376
Those kids are part of my life.

1032
01:49:32.459 --> 01:49:35.709
Even they are a part of your life.

1033
01:49:36.209 --> 01:49:38.126
Only I'm left out.

1034
01:49:39.876 --> 01:49:40.959
Hello!

1035
01:49:43.209 --> 01:49:45.293
Why do I get the feeling
you don't love me?

1036
01:49:46.293 --> 01:49:47.376
Because I don't.

1037
01:49:48.293 --> 01:49:49.709
And that you don't want to marry me.

1038
01:49:50.209 --> 01:49:51.959
Right I don't.

1039
01:49:52.043 --> 01:49:55.043
Hey! Any tantrums this time...

1040
01:49:56.543 --> 01:49:58.376
...and I'll drag you by the
hand to the marriage pandol.

1041
01:49:59.293 --> 01:50:02.793
You'll force me?
- If need be.

1042
01:50:04.543 --> 01:50:05.793
You have the guts to do it?

1043
01:50:07.626 --> 01:50:08.709
Try me.

1044
01:50:11.376 --> 01:50:12.959
I'll stay here with your aunts.

1045
01:50:13.793 --> 01:50:15.709
You go to Shimla
for your Summer Camp

1046
01:50:16.209 --> 01:50:17.293
Summer Camp!

1047
01:50:19.709 --> 01:50:20.793
Shimla!

1048
01:50:21.626 --> 01:50:23.376
Summer Camp? Shimla?

1049
01:50:23.459 --> 01:50:28.543
No way. Too much snow there.

1050
01:50:28.626 --> 01:50:29.959
Papa it's a summer camp.

1051
01:50:30.709 --> 01:50:32.959
Whatever...ls this okay?

1052
01:50:33.959 --> 01:50:36.126
Yes. Papa they teach
singing and dancing there...

1053
01:50:36.209 --> 01:50:39.126
...and you know I am fond of that.

1054
01:50:39.209 --> 01:50:41.043
Since when have you been
fond of singing and dancing?

1055
01:50:41.126 --> 01:50:43.626
I've said no means no.

1056
01:50:44.126 --> 01:50:45.543
Papa not fair.

1057
01:50:45.626 --> 01:50:48.709
Let her go. All kids go
to camps. She'll also...

1058
01:50:48.793 --> 01:50:51.626
Mom! I'll handle this okay.

1059
01:50:52.876 --> 01:50:56.209
But Rahul try and understand.
I'll also go with her...

1060
01:50:56.876 --> 01:50:58.959
Papa I want to go I
want to go please papa.

1061
01:50:59.043 --> 01:51:00.209
No Anjali.

1062
01:51:02.709 --> 01:51:09.543
Shut up. I said no. Now
neither of you will go.

1063
01:51:10.209 --> 01:51:11.959
Alright. Clear.

1064
01:51:32.043 --> 01:51:36.543
You felt bad? I'm sorry.

1065
01:51:38.959 --> 01:51:40.043
It's okay.

1066
01:51:43.209 --> 01:51:48.959
This doesn't mean you're going.
I'm going to the conference.

1067
01:51:49.043 --> 01:51:50.126
We'll talk when I get back.

1068
01:51:51.043 --> 01:51:53.043
Papa.
- Now what?

1069
01:51:53.709 --> 01:51:55.126
You haven't worn your pants.

1070
01:51:59.543 --> 01:52:02.626
It's okay you wear
it if you want to.

1071
01:52:19.376 --> 01:52:21.626
Driver take out the pant...the car.

1072
01:52:25.293 --> 01:52:30.376
Anjali...How will we make
your father come to the camp?

1073
01:52:30.459 --> 01:52:34.543
Oh Granny! Remember
when dad was in London...

1074
01:52:34.626 --> 01:52:38.543
...and I fell sick.

1075
01:52:38.626 --> 01:52:39.959
Yes my baby.

1076
01:52:40.043 --> 01:52:43.543
Granny. Papa left everything
and came back immediately.

1077
01:52:56.793 --> 01:53:00.626
Oops sorry! - Don't worry
about it man it's okay.

1078
01:53:05.126 --> 01:53:07.043
Indian Exporters Conference
good evening!

1079
01:53:07.126 --> 01:53:09.043
May I speak to Aman Mehra please?

1080
01:53:09.543 --> 01:53:10.793
Whom shall I say is calling?

1081
01:53:10.876 --> 01:53:11.959
Anjali.

1082
01:53:15.709 --> 01:53:17.543
Indian Exporters Conference
good evening!

1083
01:53:17.626 --> 01:53:19.293
Hello! Can I speak to papa?

1084
01:53:19.376 --> 01:53:20.459
Papa?

1085
01:53:20.876 --> 01:53:23.293
Your father's not a film star.
Tell her his name.

1086
01:53:23.376 --> 01:53:26.709
Sorry. May I speak to
Mr.Rahul Khanna please?

1087
01:53:27.043 --> 01:53:28.209
Whom shall I say is calling?

1088
01:53:28.293 --> 01:53:30.209
Anjali -Certainly Anjali.

1089
01:53:33.709 --> 01:53:36.043
Quickly tell him we're
going and put the phone down.

1090
01:53:41.543 --> 01:53:42.793
Hi! Rahul Khanna.

1091
01:53:56.959 --> 01:53:58.626
Hello! Aman I can't hear you.

1092
01:53:58.709 --> 01:54:00.709
I can hear you. Tell me?

1093
01:54:01.043 --> 01:54:05.043
Hi sweetheart! I'm
really missing you.

1094
01:54:07.959 --> 01:54:10.876
Listen I'm off to
the camp tomorrow.

1095
01:54:10.959 --> 01:54:12.043
Where to?

1096
01:54:12.126 --> 01:54:13.209
Summer camp.

1097
01:54:13.293 --> 01:54:16.709
Again summer camp. I said
no once to you didn't I?

1098
01:54:17.043 --> 01:54:22.209
Listen. I'm feeling very...
give me a kiss.

1099
01:54:23.126 --> 01:54:24.543
This is your mother speaking.

1100
01:54:24.876 --> 01:54:26.626
Look. I don't like these jokes.

1101
01:54:26.709 --> 01:54:28.376
My mother passed away 10 years ago.

1102
01:54:28.459 --> 01:54:31.293
Why is everyone trying to
pronounce me dead today?

1103
01:54:31.376 --> 01:54:34.293
No summer camp no
summer camp. Understood?

1104
01:54:34.376 --> 01:54:36.043
Aman why are you screaming?

1105
01:54:36.126 --> 01:54:37.543
That's because I've told you
you're not going...

1106
01:54:37.626 --> 01:54:39.043
...and you're going on.

1107
01:54:39.126 --> 01:54:43.543
If you say one more thing
I'll get home and...slap you.

1108
01:54:43.626 --> 01:54:45.293
Aman you've gone mad.

1109
01:54:48.209 --> 01:54:49.293
Afijali?

1110
01:54:50.293 --> 01:54:51.543
Your dad's gone mad.

1111
01:54:53.709 --> 01:54:57.126
Afijali?
<i>'</i> Afijali?

1112
01:54:58.209 --> 01:55:04.376
Anjali? Confusion confusion.

1113
01:55:04.459 --> 01:55:06.543
Hi! I'm Rahul Khanna.
-Aman Mehra how're you doing?

1114
01:55:06.626 --> 01:55:09.043
I guess because of the
same name she got confused...

1115
01:55:09.126 --> 01:55:12.709
Bet you my Anjali is
prettier than yours.

1116
01:55:14.543 --> 01:55:16.376
No! My Anjali is very beautiful.

1117
01:55:16.459 --> 01:55:19.543
I'm sure but not as
beautiful as mine.

1118
01:55:20.126 --> 01:55:21.876
My Anjali is my 8-year-old daughter.

1119
01:55:21.959 --> 01:55:26.293
Shit! You're right.
Your Anjali is prettier.

1120
01:55:31.543 --> 01:55:35.543
Dear Papa How are you? Sorry
we left without informing you...

1121
01:55:36.293 --> 01:55:40.293
...but you know how much I
love singing and dancing.

1122
01:55:42.876 --> 01:55:46.626
Don't miss me too much. Love Anjali.

1123
01:55:47.543 --> 01:55:48.709
That's not possible for me to do...

1124
01:55:52.543 --> 01:55:57.543
Good Morning kids. I am Col.
Almeida the camp manager.

1125
01:55:57.626 --> 01:56:03.209
I'll now measure
your height and weight.

1126
01:56:03.793 --> 01:56:10.793
24
- very nice 30 - very good. 80

1127
01:56:11.543 --> 01:56:14.293
very...what child is this?

1128
01:56:15.043 --> 01:56:18.043
Hey! Who are you?

1129
01:56:18.709 --> 01:56:20.043
Me? I am Granny.

1130
01:56:20.543 --> 01:56:21.626
Whose Granny?

1131
01:56:21.793 --> 01:56:23.626
Anjali's. Who are you?

1132
01:56:24.793 --> 01:56:26.793
Col. Almeida. Camp Manager.

1133
01:56:28.709 --> 01:56:31.709
No grannies' mummies' and
daddies' allowed on this camp.

1134
01:56:33.209 --> 01:56:35.126
So I should've let
Anjali come here alone?

1135
01:56:35.959 --> 01:56:37.043
What?

1136
01:56:37.793 --> 01:56:39.376
Have you seen Ms.Anjali?

1137
01:56:39.876 --> 01:56:40.959
Ms.Anjali!

1138
01:56:42.293 --> 01:56:44.376
What?...What?

1139
01:56:51.876 --> 01:56:58.043
The British flag in lndia...?
I'll sort him out. Almeida...

1140
01:57:03.293 --> 01:57:07.126
You have no shame? You've
hoisted the British flag.

1141
01:57:08.459 --> 01:57:10.043
I love England.

1142
01:57:10.293 --> 01:57:14.543
My father was an English tailor.

1143
01:57:14.626 --> 01:57:16.709
He made this flag.

1144
01:57:17.709 --> 01:57:20.209
Britishers went away
and left you behind.

1145
01:57:20.543 --> 01:57:25.043
You fool you should teach the
kids "My Bharat is the best".

1146
01:57:25.959 --> 01:57:27.043
Who is Bharat?

1147
01:58:13.543 --> 01:58:15.709
Here you go.
- Thank you.

1148
01:58:16.209 --> 01:58:17.876
Hey! What's your name?

1149
01:58:21.543 --> 01:58:25.709
Sorry. What's your name?
- Anjali.

1150
01:58:26.043 --> 01:58:27.959
Hey that's my name too. Hi!

1151
01:58:29.126 --> 01:58:30.709
Why is your name Anjali?

1152
01:58:33.543 --> 01:58:36.793
Perhaps my parents liked the name.

1153
01:58:37.543 --> 01:58:38.709
Why is your name Anjali?

1154
01:58:39.043 --> 01:58:42.043
Perhaps my parents liked you.

1155
01:58:48.959 --> 01:58:50.376
Where is this Almeida?

1156
01:58:59.959 --> 01:59:01.043
Namaste.

1157
01:59:11.043 --> 01:59:12.126
Almeida...

1158
01:59:16.959 --> 01:59:18.876
I need your blessings mummy.

1159
01:59:18.959 --> 01:59:20.043
Almeida.

1160
01:59:20.126 --> 01:59:23.376
Stop following me.

1161
01:59:23.459 --> 01:59:25.043
Where is the kitchen?

1162
01:59:25.126 --> 01:59:26.793
I want to see how you cook food.

1163
01:59:27.709 --> 01:59:29.376
And where is the prayer room?

1164
01:59:30.209 --> 01:59:31.376
<i>Pup has not some on duty today.</i>

1165
01:59:31.959 --> 01:59:35.376
Prayer room where
one prays to the lord.

1166
01:59:35.459 --> 01:59:37.626
We don't do that here.

1167
01:59:38.209 --> 01:59:40.876
What? There is no
prayer to the lord.

1168
01:59:41.876 --> 01:59:43.043
Lord? Who is the Lord?

1169
01:59:56.293 --> 01:59:57.376
Counting stars?...

1170
02:00:02.126 --> 02:00:03.293
Counting stars?...

1171
02:00:07.293 --> 02:00:11.793
...just doesn't speak.
Good night Mr.Almeida.

1172
02:00:12.126 --> 02:00:13.376
Good night darling.

1173
02:00:13.459 --> 02:00:16.293
London Bridge is
falling down falling down...

1174
02:00:24.543 --> 02:00:25.626
...up

1175
02:00:35.959 --> 02:00:37.709
Dear God How are you?

1176
02:00:39.126 --> 02:00:42.043
Please keep papa
happy and see that...

1177
02:00:42.126 --> 02:00:43.709
...he doesn't miss me too much.

1178
02:00:44.043 --> 02:00:48.793
You know he can't do
anything without me. Okay.

1179
02:00:49.543 --> 02:00:50.626
Caught you.

1180
02:00:56.126 --> 02:00:58.376
All prayers for papa
nothing for mama?

1181
02:00:59.543 --> 02:01:02.293
Why ask God for anything for mummy?

1182
02:01:02.543 --> 02:01:03.626
Why?

1183
02:01:03.709 --> 02:01:07.543
She's with him. Whatever she wants
she can ask for it herself.

1184
02:01:17.793 --> 02:01:22.126
Hey! Now go to sleep. Sweet dreams.

1185
02:01:29.709 --> 02:01:30.793
Miss you Papa-

1186
02:01:40.126 --> 02:01:42.543
Hi guys! Welcome to
the Neelam Show...

1187
02:01:42.626 --> 02:01:45.293
...and today we are
coming to you live.

1188
02:01:45.543 --> 02:01:50.043
There's so much noise here
so check it out...

1189
02:02:04.126 --> 02:02:07.543
Hi Guys! This is Neelam
and you're watching...

1190
02:02:07.626 --> 02:02:08.793
...The Neelam Show.

1191
02:02:08.876 --> 02:02:12.043
Like always we're going to do
something new and different.

1192
02:02:12.293 --> 02:02:15.709
Today's theme is love messages.

1193
02:02:18.709 --> 02:02:19.793
Messages anyone?

1194
02:02:19.876 --> 02:02:22.959
I have a message.
- We've got one here.

1195
02:02:24.376 --> 02:02:25.876
Whom is your message for?

1196
02:02:25.959 --> 02:02:27.043
Superna.

1197
02:02:27.209 --> 02:02:28.293
Who is Superna.

1198
02:02:28.376 --> 02:02:29.459
My girlfriend.

1199
02:02:32.709 --> 02:02:33.793
Your message?

1200
02:02:34.543 --> 02:02:38.543
Look Superna. Don't call me.
I've found someone else.

1201
02:02:48.543 --> 02:02:50.043
Hey! another message.

1202
02:02:58.543 --> 02:02:59.626
I want to give a message too.

1203
02:03:06.959 --> 02:03:08.126
Like the one he gave...

1204
02:03:08.376 --> 02:03:10.709
And his message is for...

1205
02:03:10.793 --> 02:03:16.126
For Anjali...l love you Anjali.

1206
02:03:20.293 --> 02:03:21.709
Why have you left me and gone?

1207
02:03:23.376 --> 02:03:25.793
You know I feel lost without you.

1208
02:03:27.543 --> 02:03:31.376
Come back or else...just come back.

1209
02:03:36.709 --> 02:03:37.793
Please come back.

1210
02:03:40.293 --> 02:03:42.376
Who is Anjali?

1211
02:03:45.293 --> 02:03:47.543
She's my 8-year-old daughter.

1212
02:03:48.959 --> 02:03:51.959
She's gone to some camp in Shimla.

1213
02:03:52.459 --> 02:03:56.793
Neelam can you tell her to
come back? She'll listen to you.

1214
02:03:58.209 --> 02:04:00.709
Anjali...Papa really loves you.

1215
02:04:01.376 --> 02:04:03.793
Come back soon. He misses you.

1216
02:04:04.709 --> 02:04:06.793
Come back home. Okay.

1217
02:04:45.376 --> 02:04:48.209
Mr.Khanna meeting for
tomorrow at 11 a.m. is confirmed.

1218
02:04:49.876 --> 02:04:51.543
Ooops Mr.Khanna
forgot to tell you...

1219
02:04:51.626 --> 02:04:52.709
...the fax has arrived from London.

1220
02:04:53.543 --> 02:04:57.709
Hi Rahul! Party at my
place tomorrow. See you there.

1221
02:04:58.543 --> 02:05:01.376
Papa...aachoo. -Cold...?

1222
02:09:44.543 --> 02:09:45.626
Hi!

1223
02:09:50.709 --> 02:09:55.043
Are you feeling okay?

1224
02:09:56.293 --> 02:09:57.376
Yeah. Why?

1225
02:09:58.043 --> 02:10:04.626
No. You're looking...beautiful
that's why...Saree.

1226
02:10:11.626 --> 02:10:15.126
I didn't know about Tina. I'm sorry.

1227
02:10:19.043 --> 02:10:21.626
How could you know?
You just disappeared.

1228
02:10:23.209 --> 02:10:24.376
We changed our residence.

1229
02:10:24.959 --> 02:10:26.209
You changed your friends as well?

1230
02:10:28.793 --> 02:10:32.376
When I needed my friend
the most you were not there.

1231
02:10:38.126 --> 02:10:39.543
You didn't marry again?

1232
02:10:40.543 --> 02:10:43.626
Couldn't find you...or
else would have married you.

1233
02:10:47.376 --> 02:10:53.626
We live once die once
get married once and love...

1234
02:10:54.126 --> 02:10:55.209
Only once.

1235
02:10:57.959 --> 02:10:59.376
You didn't get married either?

1236
02:11:01.043 --> 02:11:02.126
Couldn't find you.

1237
02:11:05.959 --> 02:11:11.626
Hey! Look a shooting star.
- Still believe in it?

1238
02:11:13.043 --> 02:11:17.126
No.You?
- No.

1239
02:11:38.793 --> 02:11:43.126
Anjali...what did you wish for?

1240
02:12:08.543 --> 02:12:09.626
Granny.

1241
02:12:12.043 --> 02:12:14.293
What news?
- Bad news.

1242
02:12:14.626 --> 02:12:17.543
They are behaving like
they're meeting for the first time.

1243
02:12:17.626 --> 02:12:19.876
Good night Rahul Good night Anjali.

1244
02:12:20.209 --> 02:12:23.876
Now what do we do?

1245
02:12:26.043 --> 02:12:27.626
You have any idea granny?

1246
02:12:29.543 --> 02:12:35.543
The solution now lies
in prayer and devotion.

1247
02:12:36.376 --> 02:12:41.543
Oh Granny. Now you
only tell me what to do?

1248
02:12:56.293 --> 02:12:58.209
Hey! What are you doing?
Have you gone mad?

1249
02:12:59.543 --> 02:13:00.793
Is this what I have taught you?

1250
02:13:01.876 --> 02:13:02.959
Leave her Rohan. Stop it.

1251
02:13:03.043 --> 02:13:04.293
Big boys don't fight she's a girl.

1252
02:13:04.376 --> 02:13:05.459
Why are you fighting?

1253
02:13:05.543 --> 02:13:06.626
She hit me first.

1254
02:13:06.709 --> 02:13:10.043
I just said that girls can
play Basketball and he said...

1255
02:13:10.126 --> 02:13:12.043
Boo girls can't play Basketball.

1256
02:13:12.376 --> 02:13:14.126
He said the truth and
you fought with him.

1257
02:13:14.209 --> 02:13:17.543
Why! In college Ms.Anjali
beat you everyday in Basketball.

1258
02:13:17.626 --> 02:13:23.543
Shh! Quiet! Not everyday sometimes.

1259
02:13:29.293 --> 02:13:31.293
Rahul you lost everyday.
- No Anjali.

1260
02:13:31.376 --> 02:13:32.543
Yes Rahul.

1261
02:13:33.043 --> 02:13:35.209
Don't lie in front of the kids.

1262
02:13:35.293 --> 02:13:36.876
What I'm lying?

1263
02:13:36.959 --> 02:13:38.793
So am I lying? Liar.
- What?

1264
02:13:39.876 --> 02:13:42.626
The truth is you
could only cheat and win.

1265
02:13:42.709 --> 02:13:44.543
Hey! don't call me a cheater.

1266
02:13:44.876 --> 02:13:47.959
That's what you are...a cheater.

1267
02:13:48.043 --> 02:13:49.126
Anjali not cheater.

1268
02:13:49.543 --> 02:13:51.126
Rahul is a cheater.

1269
02:13:51.209 --> 02:13:55.126
Oh no! She's started.
Don't listen to her.

1270
02:14:08.543 --> 02:14:12.543
I challenge you
right now let's play.

1271
02:14:16.376 --> 02:14:18.043
Don't be silly Anjali.

1272
02:14:19.709 --> 02:14:22.709
Why? Are you scared Rahul?

1273
02:14:25.043 --> 02:14:27.959
RahulKhannais
